  "title": "Brian C NDE 3826",
  "date": "10-3-1989",
  "content": "When I got to the emergency room lying on stretcher, it was like I was looking down on myself and body, no pain. Could hear nurses and doctors talking. They were cutting my pants and clothes off. Nurse saying get a catheter, me peeing everywhere, laughing. Everything seemed real white, clear, vivid 3D. Then I black out, the pain, seeing my bones popped out and blood. I survived emergency surgery and two days later get pneumonia, lungs, feel like dying hurts to breathe. When I was age five my uncle died, my mom's brother, had vision everything goes white, then see big blue Olympic size pool and my uncles there. We jump off the diving board and into pool, rest on the side of pool, he tells me everything is going to be okay and I will live, felt peace, joy, happiness.",
